<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl"><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div class="relative inline-flex w-fit items-center" style="--tag-delay:0ms"><span class="absolute inset-y-0 z-10 flex items-center left-0"><span class="inline-block size-3 bg-coral md:size-3.5 tag-heading_node___8Rfq" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center font-mono uppercase gap-3 text-eyebrow md:gap-4 md:text-eyebrow-lg text-black [[data-theme=dark]_&amp;]:text-white pl-6 md:pl-7.5 tag-heading_bar__Hp10z">Key benefits</span></div><div class="w-full"><div class="relative w-full h-[var(--spacer-height)]" style="--spacer-height:clamp(4.5rem, calc(4.5rem + 3 * ((100vw - 20rem) / 76)), 7.5rem)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:gap-6 xl:gap-20"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-24 md:gap-40"><div aria-current="step" class="lg:transition-opacity lg:duration-450 lg:ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between lg:gap-10"><span class="font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase text-very-subtle lg:order-2">01</span><h3 class="font-heading text-heading-sm text-default-dark lg:transition-colors lg:duration-450 lg:ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none xl:text-heading-md">Build your equity foundation</h3></div><p class="mt-6 font-body text-body-base text-default-dark lg:mt-10 lg:text-body-lg">Simplify your equity plan with cap table software that lets you issue and track shares, as well as process payments securely from one platform.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-col lg:mt-10"><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Manage company ownership</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base">Cap table management, data rooms</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Build investor transparency</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base">Digital certificates, dashboards</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Build employee equity grants</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base">Hiring plans, option grants</p></li></ul><img loading="lazy" width="520" height="520" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto mt-6 h-auto max-h-100 w-auto object-contain lg:hidden" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/59wgBLAJFFVx217hIdDMmt/eb0b45455db63d4c4e828cfce64fba51/Build_on_a_solid_foundation.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/59wgBLAJFFVx217hIdDMmt/eb0b45455db63d4c4e828cfce64fba51/Build_on_a_solid_foundation.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/59wgBLAJFFVx217hIdDMmt/eb0b45455db63d4c4e828cfce64fba51/Build_on_a_solid_foundation.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div class="lg:transition-opacity lg:duration-450 lg:ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none lg:opacity-20"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between lg:gap-10"><span class="font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase text-very-subtle lg:order-2">02</span><h3 class="font-heading text-heading-sm text-default-dark lg:transition-colors lg:duration-450 lg:ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none xl:text-heading-md lg:text-very-subtle">Design your company’s future</h3></div><p class="mt-6 font-body text-body-base text-default-dark lg:mt-10 lg:text-body-lg">Scale efficiently with streamlined workflows for fundraising, issuing securities, and managing equity, all connected to your cap table.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-col lg:mt-10"><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Model complex fundraising scenarios</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base"> Forecast SAFE conversion, share prices</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Refresh your employee plans</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base">Hiring plans, stock option plans</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Close SAFE and preferred share deals</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base">Issue docs, collect signatures, data rooms</p></li></ul><img loading="lazy" width="520" height="520" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto mt-6 h-auto max-h-100 w-auto object-contain lg:hidden" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3OMmu5oy7NjeirqZMSKVqV/8763ed7f320e49f5386ae8ea8553d0a1/Fastrack_your_growth.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3OMmu5oy7NjeirqZMSKVqV/8763ed7f320e49f5386ae8ea8553d0a1/Fastrack_your_growth.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3OMmu5oy7NjeirqZMSKVqV/8763ed7f320e49f5386ae8ea8553d0a1/Fastrack_your_growth.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div class="lg:transition-opacity lg:duration-450 lg:ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none lg:opacity-20"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between lg:gap-10"><span class="font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase text-very-subtle lg:order-2">03</span><h3 class="font-heading text-heading-sm text-default-dark lg:transition-colors lg:duration-450 lg:ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none xl:text-heading-md lg:text-very-subtle">Stay compliant, automatically</h3></div><p class="mt-6 font-body text-body-base text-default-dark lg:mt-10 lg:text-body-lg">Experience peace of mind with built-in compliance support that helps you follow the rules, even if you don’t know them all.</p><ul class="mt-6 flex flex-col lg:mt-10"><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Get audit-ready reports on demand</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base">IFRS13 and 409A valuations</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Generate compliance forms</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base">ESS reporting, VCC, ACRA</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-gray-40 py-4 lg:gap-2 xl:py-5"><span class="font-body text-subhead-xs text-default-dark lg:text-subhead-sm xl:text-subhead">Streamline compliance processes</span><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-subtle-dark xl:text-body-base">Account health checks, maintain audit trail</p></li></ul><img loading="lazy" width="520" height="520" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto mt-6 h-auto max-h-100 w-auto object-contain lg:hidden" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3IrAwMdd9GpqbbL4uiOqOF/abe51cd5538896fcfd8d8441e43058a7/Stay_compliant__automatically.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3IrAwMdd9GpqbbL4uiOqOF/abe51cd5538896fcfd8d8441e43058a7/Stay_compliant__automatically.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3IrAwMdd9GpqbbL4uiOqOF/abe51cd5538896fcfd8d8441e43058a7/Stay_compliant__automatically.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div></div><div class="hidden flex-1 lg:block"><div class="sticky top-[calc(50dvh-35%)]"><div class="relative flex w-full items-center justify-center"><div aria-hidden="false" aria-current="step" class="transition-opacity duration-900 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none relative opacity-100"><img loading="lazy" width="520" height="520" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="pointer-events-none max-h-130 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/59wgBLAJFFVx217hIdDMmt/eb0b45455db63d4c4e828cfce64fba51/Build_on_a_solid_foundation.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/59wgBLAJFFVx217hIdDMmt/eb0b45455db63d4c4e828cfce64fba51/Build_on_a_solid_foundation.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/59wgBLAJFFVx217hIdDMmt/eb0b45455db63d4c4e828cfce64fba51/Build_on_a_solid_foundation.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="transition-opacity duration-900 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none absolute opacity-0"><img loading="lazy" width="520" height="520" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="pointer-events-none max-h-130 w-auto object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3OMmu5oy7NjeirqZMSKVqV/8763ed7f320e49f5386ae8ea8553d0a1/Fastrack_your_growth.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3OMmu5oy7NjeirqZMSKVqV/8763ed7f320e49f5386ae8ea8553d0a1/Fastrack_your_growth.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/3OMmu5oy7NjeirqZMSKVqV/8763ed7f320e49f5386ae8ea8553d0a1/Fastrack_your_growth.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="transition-opacity duration-900 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none absolute opacity-0"><img loading="lazy" width="520" height="520" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="pointer-events-none max-h-130 w-auto object-conta