.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4SsAEpJkLU3fzXrmmwXWJ8/31efa98a8473f716d957ae9d92909b99/Endowus_BW.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4SsAEpJkLU3fzXrmmwXWJ8/31efa98a8473f716d957ae9d92909b99/Endowus_BW.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4SsAEpJkLU3fzXrmmwXWJ8/31efa98a8473f716d957ae9d92909b99/Endowus_BW.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-8"><img alt="PowWater" loading="lazy" width="300" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-37.5 h-auto object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/66p3l5VCBFshkZ6DggFl5c/481bffdb4def8d14a69b503574221430/PowWater.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/66p3l5VCBFshkZ6DggFl5c/481bffdb4def8d14a69b503574221430/PowWater.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/66p3l5VCBFshkZ6DggFl5c/481bffdb4def8d14a69b503574221430/PowWater.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div></div></div></div></section><div class="w-full"><div class="relative w-full h-[var(--spacer-height)]" style="--spacer-height:clamp(1.75rem, calc(1.75rem + 0.75 * ((100vw - 20rem) / 76)), 2.5rem)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><section class="w-full px-page-margin bg-white"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl"><div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-6"><section role="region" aria-label="Testimonial carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel" tabindex="0" class="outline-none"><ul class="flex gap-0 sm:gap-2 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory scrollbar-none list-none m-0 p-0"><li class="shrink-0 snap-start w-full sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/2)] lg:w-[calc((100%-1rem)/3)]"><a href="/sg/en/customer-stories/endowus/" class="relative flex flex-col gap-8 items-start p-6 h-full bg-light-gray transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-gray focus-visible:bg-gray" data-cta="true"><div class="relative shrink-0 size-25 overflow-clip"><img alt="Headshot of Dominic Ong, CFO and head of strategic partnerships at Endowus." loading="lazy" width="708" height="692" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-cover size-full" style="color:transparent" sizes="100px" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=32&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 32w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=48&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 48w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=64&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 64w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=96&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 96w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=128&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 128w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 256w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=750&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=828&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4FmM2BQPx3vPCvyW4UmLJ4/50a9044178f769919ec681469d9b65e3/Screenshot-2024-02-27-at-3.17.00-PM.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 size-6" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/img/Quotation-mark.svg 1x, /img/Quotation-mark.svg 2x" src="/img/Quotation-mark.svg"/></div><p class="font-body text-body-lg text-black">Carta has helped us to clean up all of our data, giving us a lot more confidence, for both tracking and reporting purposes, especially since we have investors who expect to have this data at their fingertips.</p><div class="flex flex-col font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase w-full mt-auto text-subtle-dark"><p>Dominic Ong</p><p>CFO, EndowUs</p></div><svg class="absolute top-0 left-31 size-28 pointer-events-none" viewBox="0 0 112.5 112.5" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M112 0C112 61.8559 61.8559 112 0 112" stroke="var(--color-coral)" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></path></svg></a></li><li class="shrink-0 snap-start w-full sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/2)] lg:w-[calc((100%-1rem)/3)]"><a href="/sg/en/customer-stories/powwater/" class="relative flex flex-col gap-8 items-start p-6 h-full bg-light-gray transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-gray focus-visible:bg-gray" data-cta="true"><div class="relative shrink-0 size-25 overflow-clip"><img alt="Jack Hartpence headshot" loading="lazy" width="476" height="476" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-cover size-full" style="color:transparent" sizes="100px" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=32&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 32w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=48&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 48w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=64&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 64w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=96&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 96w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=128&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 128w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 256w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=750&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=828&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/1rIA5clBZrBElkiBb03GUD/ceaf29a63362d13c3f72b469af5b5829/Jack_Hartpence.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 size-6" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/img/Quotation-mark.svg 1x, /img/Quotation-mark.svg 2x" src="/img/Quotation-mark.svg"/></div><p class="font-body text-body-lg text-black">For cap table management, Carta’s spot on. It’s become the backbone of how we manage ownership, and I’m excited to explore how we can extend that foundation into some of their fundraising tools and beyond. </p><div class="flex flex-col font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase w-full mt-auto text-subtle-dark"><p>Jack Hartpence</p><p>Co-Founder and CEO, PowWater </p></div><svg class="absolute top-0 left-31 size-28 pointer-events-none" viewBox="0 0 112.5 112.5" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M112 0C112 61.8559 61.8559 112 0 112" stroke="var(--color-coral)" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></path></svg></a></li><li class="shrink-0 snap-start w-full sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/2)] lg:w-[calc((100%-1rem)/3)]"><a href="/sg/en/customer-stories/dovetail/" class="relative flex flex-col gap-8 items-start p-6 h-full bg-light-gray transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-gray focus-visible:bg-gray" data-cta="true"><div class="relative shrink-0 size-25 overflow-clip"><img alt="Headshot of Yonas Tejoputranto, Head of Finance at Dovetail." loading="lazy" width="234" height="234" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-cover size-full" style="color:transparent" sizes="100px" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=32&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 32w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=48&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 48w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=64&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 64w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=96&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 96w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=128&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 128w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 256w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=384&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=640&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=750&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=828&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 3840w" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/4zrFOnVDbm04hZ4Apmgo2p/a6ef0681d076fdac19194eb99a7d7f70/Yonas-dovetail.png?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 size-6" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/img/Quotation-mark.svg 1x, /img/Quotation-mark.svg 2x" src="/img/Quotation-mark.svg"/></div><p class="font-body text-body-lg text-black">We will definitely lean on Carta for our next round of funding... Having APAC-based support meant we always had someone available who understood our context and could jump in quickly to help.</p><div class="flex flex-col font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase w-full mt-auto text-subtle-dark"><p>Yonas Tejoputranto</p><p>Head of Finance, Dovetail</p></div><svg class="absolute top-0 left-31 size-28 pointer-events-none" viewBox="0 0 112.5 112.5" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M112 0C112 61.8559 61.8559 112 0 112" stroke="var(--color-coral)" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></path></svg></a></li></ul></section><div aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between lg:hidden"><p class="font-mono text-eyebrow uppercase text-subtle-dark">1<!-- --> / <!-- -->1</p><div class="flex gap-2"><button data-button-kind="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-body-base transition-all duration-200 ease-out cursor-pointer disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opa