 </h3><div class="w-full h-2" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="font-body text-body-base text-subtle-dark">Learn the ins and outs of equity management and how to build a foundation for shared success.</p></div></a></li><li class="flex" data-resource-card=""><a href="/sg/en/learn/equity/stock-options/?ir=corps_captable_related3" aria-label="What are stock options?" class="group relative flex flex-col items-start bg-white p-4 md:p-6 outline-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-black flex-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden shrink-0 size-7 bg-coral absolute top-0 right-0 transition-colors duration-200 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none group-hover:bg-gray"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block shrink-0 bg-current size-3.5" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(/icons/magna/ArrowRight.svg);-webkit-mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(/icons/magna/ArrowRight.svg);mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;color:var(--color-default-dark)"></span></span><span class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-eyebrow-sm uppercase bg-gray-40 px-1.5">Article</span><div class="w-full h-6" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="flex flex-col w-full"><h3 class="font-heading text-balance text-heading-2xs md:text-heading-xs text-default-dark">What are stock options?</h3><div class="w-full h-2" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="font-body text-body-base text-subtle-dark">Understand the different types of stock options companies use to compensate their employees.</p></div></a></li><li class="flex" data-resource-card=""><a href="/sg/en/learn/collections/early-stage-founder/?ir=corps_captable_related4" aria-label="Carta Classroom" class="group relative flex flex-col items-start bg-white p-4 md:p-6 outline-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible