v class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-200 text-body-base text-gray-80 pt-2 pb-6"><div class="[&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1"><p>Yes. If you&#x27;re a company with under 25 employees and raised up to $1 million, you can sign up for Carta Launch and access a full suite of equity management software—<a href="/sg/en/equity-management/launch/" class="link-underline-inline">for free</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="border-b border-black"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex" data-slot="accordion-header"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_2lqalubt5viv5tnb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_lqalubt5viv5tnb_" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="flex items-start w-full group py-4 gap-6 md:py-6 md:gap-12 outline-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-black cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="flex-1 text-black text-left text-body-lg md:text-body-xl">Can I get a demo of the cap table management product?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex transition-transform duration-400 ease-in-out group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180 mt-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block shrink-0 bg-current size-[1.1875rem] md:size-6" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(/icons/magna/ArrowDown.svg);-webkit-mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(/icons/magna/ArrowDown.svg);mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;color:var(--color-default-dark)"></span></span></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2lqalubt5viv5tnb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_lqalubt5viv5tnb_" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="group block" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,visibility] duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[state=open]:grid-rows-[1fr] invisible group-data-[state=open]:visible"><div class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-200 text-body-base text-gray-80 pt-2 pb-6"><div class="[&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1"><p>You can sign up for a demo <a href="/sg/en/demo/apac/" class="link-underline-inline">here</a>, or take a <a href="/sg/en/tour/watch/corporations/" class="link-underline-inline">video tour</a> to learn more on how this cap table management software works.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="border-b border-black"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex" data-slot="accordion-header"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_2tqalubt5viv5tnb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_tqalubt5viv5tnb_" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="flex items-start w-full group py-4 gap-6 md:py-6 md:gap-12 outline-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-black cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="flex-1 text-black text-left text-body-lg md:text-body-xl">What could I expect from the onboarding process?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex transition-transform duration-400 ease-in-out group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180 mt-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block shrink-0 bg-current size-[1.1875rem] md:size-6" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(/icons/magna/ArrowDown.svg);-webkit-mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(/icons/magna/ArrowDown.svg);mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;color:var(--color-default-dark)"></span></span></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_2tqalubt5viv5tnb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_tqalubt5viv5tnb_" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="group block" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,visibility] duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] group-data-[state=open]:grid-rows-[1fr] invisible group-data-[state=open]:visible"><div class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-200 text-body-base text-gray-80 pt-2 pb-6"><div class="[&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1"><p>Once you sign up, the implementations team will provide full support as you get started. Depending on the size of your company, you can be onboarded onto Carta in a matter of hours.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="border-b border-black"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex" data-slot="accordion-header"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_35qalubt5viv5tnb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_15qalubt5viv5tnb_" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="flex items-start w-full group py-4 gap-6 md:py-6 md:gap-12 outline-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-solid focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-black cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="flex-1 text-black text-left text-body-lg md:text-body-xl">Does Carta offer products to support Private Equity firms?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex transition-transform duration-400 ease-in-out group-data-[state=open]:rotate-180 mt-1"><span aria-hi