n Carta help my startup?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. If you're a company with under 25 employees and raised up to $1 million, you can sign up for Carta Launch and access a full suite of equity management software—for free.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I get a demo of the cap table management product?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can sign up for a demo here, or take a video tour to learn more on how this cap table management software works.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What could I expect from the onboarding process?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Once you sign up, the implementations team will provide full support as you get started. Depending on the size of your company, you can be onboarded onto Carta in a matter of hours.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does Carta offer products to support Private Equity firms?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Carta has helped hundreds of private equity backed companies and firms implement equity plans and manage ownership. Get in touch with one of the team to discuss options or learn more here.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What can I expect from the onboarding process?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Once you sign up, the implementations team will provide full support as you get started. Depending on the size of your company, you can be onboarded onto Carta in a matter of hours.\"}}]}8:[false,[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"id\":\"schema-webpage\",\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$21\"}}],null],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"id\":\"schema-faqpage\",\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$22\"}}],\"$L23\",\"$L24\"]\n25:I[32023,[\"8437\",\"static/chunks/8437-55755f5aca822e9e.js\",\"9144\",\"static/chunks/9144-c42ada5ff1b0abc3.js\",\"6684\",\"static/chunks/6684-8efa48e7b9b8d6cd.js\",\"335\",\"sta