 with global benchmarks.\",\"href\":\"/sg/en/equity-management/cap-table/valuations/\",\"linkLabel\":\"Learn more\",\"media\":{\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/2SAOR37Hc2ynyXYspWrLIL/56241b45167349c4a724cde0b13426c4/Valuations_-_updated.png\",\"alt\":\"UI of 409A Valuation summary with button to download report\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":675,\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"size\":\"$undefined\"},\"lottie\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"}},{\"label\":\"Financial Reporting\",\"description\":\"Create detailed, accurate stock-based compensation reports on demand.\",\"href\":\"/sg/en/equity-management/cap-table/financial-reporting/\",\"linkLabel\":\"Learn more\",\"media\":{\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/23eUxitrVl4cg7V9NoDo5V/d2e8962ed2cc9521bddd2e162aeb562e/Financial_reporting.png\",\"alt\":\"Cap Table UI | Feature | Product Page | \\\"Financial reporting\\\"\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":675,\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"size\":\"$undefined\"},\"lottie\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"}},{\"label\":\"Scenario Modeling\",\"description\":\" Understand the impact of future fundraising rounds on your ownership.\",\"href\":\"/sg/en/equity-management/cap-table/scenario-modeling/\",\"linkLabel\":\"Learn more\",\"media\":{\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/y88td1zx1ufe/7hzNyo2w4B1eyLgEFn4vy8/d80f0f84493a087ce43f52561a9422fc/Cap_Table_-_Scenario_modeling.png\",\"alt\":\"Cap Table UI | Feature | Product Page | \\\"Scenario modeling\",\"width\":1124,\"height\":632,\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"size\":\"$undefined\"},\"lottie\":\"$undefined\",\"video\":\"$undefined\"}}]}]\n48:I[86869,[],\"IconMark\"]\na:null\nf:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"The Leader in Cap Table Management Software | Carta APAC\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Manage your cap table and issue equity with Carta's real-time cap table software —trusted by over 50,000 private com